{"games":[{"id":1069951594,"name":"Fall of Hell","desc":"⚠️ Increase your graphics settings if obstacles go invisible\n\nThis game is inspired by The Dropper and Tower of Hell\n\nUPDATE V1.2 RELEASE NOTES:\n🗺️ Change difficulty of the map to your liking\n📷 Spectate others\n🌟 Global leaderboards have been added\n🧱 Some obstacles have been tweaked\n🐛 Bug fixes\n\nWelcome to the torturous game called Fall of Hell! Dive down a hole and try to reach the end without dying. It's harder than it sounds so beware and good luck, you'll need it >:D\n\nItems bought in-game are only available in this game","path":"/game/1069951594-fall-of-hell","slug":"1069951594-fall-of-hell","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9a7a560586f16be5b961ca7f7ca6b401/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d63fda7f6a9324994abdb8b4311d3e28/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":7,"visitor":447900706,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-11T01:05:22.009Z","creator":{"name":"NOOBEstudios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12109411976,"name":"Noob Tycoon 🙂","desc":"Collect Tix from the noobs and throw them into the currency exchange! Use your money to buy more noobs and merge them together to make them more powerful! Compete with your friends to earn a spot on the leaderboards!\n\n😋 Unlock wacky and powerful noobs!\n🎫 Toss your Tix into the currency exchange for money!\n💾 Tycoon progress automatically saves!\n♻️ Noobs automatically merge at 208 noobs to prevent lag!\n\n⭐ If you enjoyed the game, \"Favorite\" and \"Follow\" it to be the first to hear about new updates!\n\n👍 Remember to like the game! A community reward will be unlocked at 30,000 likes!\n[👍 20k Likes] Code \"noob20\"\n[👍10k Likes] Code \"oof10\"\n[👍 5k Likes] Code \"noway5k\"\n[👍1k Likes] Code \"hooray1k\"","path":"/game/12109411976-noob-tycoon","slug":"12109411976-noob-tycoon","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-82df976bee06771873413ef0402a421b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7839a5f2c48102046fc666253a1e2dfe/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":7,"visitor":15484300,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-31T12:09:20.583Z","creator":{"name":"Blue Elephant","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6924952561,"name":"Clover City","desc":"Join the group for a permanent glowstick item!\r\n\r\nWarning: This game is difficult.\r\n\r\nAccount must be at least 2 weeks old to play!\r\n\r\n💸You can get money by robbing Safes, killing NPCs or getting a job.\r\n💥Most small structures like the streetlights, fire hydrants, and trees can be damaged with any gun or melee.\r\n🪓You can gather wood from the fallen trees and use to barricade certain places\r\n🏠Customize and build your own home\r\n💪Get bigger or smaller at the gym\r\n🕵Explore and discover secrets\r\n\r\nBasic Controls:\r\nHold down to charge your melee attacks.  Max damage when the fist glows.\r\nE, Stomp | G, Carry | Q Mouselock (must have mouselock active)\r\nF, Block | Ctrl, Crouch | Shift, Run\r\n\r\nGreen bar is your health.  Yellow bar is your stamina.\r\n💫Means you're knocked out, stomping someone knocked out will damage them\r\n⚠️Means you're down, stomping someone down will kill them\r\n☠️Means you're dead\r\n\r\nGame similar to Da Hood, Criminality and aspects of Ohio.","path":"/game/6924952561-clover-city","slug":"6924952561-clover-city","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-815d523621d80c52f4d001e87698e398/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":7,"visitor":15641993,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-18T17:56:59.691Z","creator":{"name":"Digital Cosmos","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14417300475,"name":"[🎉ANNIVERSARY] unLimited","desc":"In a world where everybody has supernatural abilities, rise to the peak as the strongest of your school's hierarchy! Gain fantastical powers, and conquer other players to reach the summit of unLimited!\nBased off the webtoon, unOrdinary.\n\n❗To enter codes, type \"![code here]\"\nLatest code: !MAP\n\n⭐New Code at 2M Visits!\n⭐New Code at 5k Likes!\n⭐New Code at 3k Members!","path":"/game/14417300475-anniversary-unlimited","slug":"14417300475-anniversary-unlimited","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d28b1768721a0eecc1356ac238844506/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6a4ef0bef192ade00e676e9e5cc90c6e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":7,"visitor":1678577,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-28T15:26:47.970Z","creator":{"name":"Unlimited Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6375883252,"name":"Trepidation [NEW CODE]","desc":"Something evil is hunting you... Complete the objectives and escape before time runs out.\n\nTrepidation is a multiplayer asymmetrical survival horror game where up to 8 Survivors must work together to complete objectives, rescue teammates, unlock the exit, and escape while being hunted by a powerful Killer.\n\nEvery match is different. Search for materials to craft items and use weapons or abilities to help you survive. Make risky choices to protect your team before they're killed off one by one...\n\n◉ SURVIVORS: Work together, complete objectives, rescue teammates, and escape.\n◉ KILLER: Use unique powers and abilities to hunt down and kill every Survivor before they escape.\n◉ PROGRESSION: Unlock new Survivors, Killers, cosmetics, upgrades, and rewards as you play.\n\n[CROSSOVER EVENT AT 13K LIKES]\n\n-This is an ongoing passion project worked on and maintained by a single developer. Feedback and bug reports are greatly appreciated!- ","path":"/game/6375883252-trepidation-new-code","slug":"6375883252-trepidation-new-code","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dcba4069d781b0b7a97f98a9917ed6f